    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the real property tax law, in relation to requiring assessors\nusing the comparable sales, income capitalization or cost method for\nassessments to consider certain comparable properties in formulating the\nassessment",
    "basePrintNo": "S5674",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S5674-2019",
